    "description": "Studies related to the content of non-structural sweeten in Desachampsia\nantarctica, have been made since 1992.  It has been found that the plant\naccumulates high levels of saccharose and fructose. Another evaluation is the\nrespiratory and photosynthetic plant capacity under different environmental\nconditions. This plant does not present the photoinhibition process. It has\nbeen determinate the temperature that inhibited the breathing.",
